## Port of pumpkin-protocol/src/serial/mod.rs: upstream declares the `PacketWrite`,
## `PacketRead` and `PacketReadSlice` traits and `read_str_slice` here. Traits do
## not exist in aowlmony, so what remains is the module that gathers the overloads:
## `packetWrite`/`packetWriteBe` in serialwrite.aowl and `packetRead`/`packetReadBe`
## (which also covers `PacketReadSlice` and `read_str_slice`) in serialread.aowl.
## The `#[derive(PacketWrite, PacketRead)]` macros from pumpkin-macros become a
## hand-written pair per packet, as Java packets are; see proto.aowl's header.

import serialwrite, serialread, u24type, uuid

export serialwrite, serialread, u24type, uuid
